sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Front as Caller
    participant Entry as Entry point
    participant Service as Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Front->>Front: make the id, a UUID v7
    Front->>+Entry: create, with the id
    Entry->>Entry: refuse an id that is no UUID v7: invalid
    Entry->>+Service: the command, with the id
    Service->>+DB: insert under the id
    DB-->>-Service: saved
    Service-->>-Entry: created
    Entry-->>-Front: created
    Front->>+Entry: create, the same id, the answer lost
    Entry->>+Service: the command, with the id
    Service->>+DB: insert under the id
    DB-->>-Service: duplicate key
    Service-->>-Entry: conflict
    Entry-->>-Front: conflict: the id is taken
